<title>USA: Freeport-McMoRan Copper Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Freeport-McMoRan Copper Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW ORLEANS 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.31		    $0.11</p>
<p> Net			 62,451		   22,450</p>
<p> Revs		     523,780		  388,392</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 203,047		  198,530</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Full name of company is Freeport-McMoRan Copper &amp; Gold Inc.</p>
<p>Q1 1996 results include charges totaling $18.7 million ($8.6 million to net income, or $0.04 per share) from costs of stock appreciation rights and other charges.</p>
<p>Q1 1997 operating income was $197.6 million vs $105.5 million for Q1 1996.</p>
<p>First Call estimate for Q1 1997 was $0.28 per share.</p>
</text>
